## 8. Quick reference commands

```bash
# ── Git ──
git checkout -b feature/<name>-<task>
git push -u origin HEAD
gh pr create --base develop --title "..." --body "..."

# ── Local UI (dev API) ──
npm run dev:customer | dev:vendor | dev:admin

# ── Local full stack ──
cd backend/lambda && npm run start:local
npm run local:customer

# ── Migration (dev) ──
ENVIRONMENT=dev node scripts/run-migration-rds-node.js <file>.sql

# ── Deploy dev ──
./scripts/deploy-lambda-direct.sh
./scripts/deploy-customer-web.sh

# ── Deploy prod (explicit user request only) ──
LAMBDA_FUNCTION_NAME=warmpawz-prod-api-handler ./scripts/deploy-lambda-direct.sh
./scripts/deploy-customer-web.sh --prod
ENVIRONMENT=prod node scripts/run-migration-rds-node.js <file>.sql
```

