## 9. Agent behavior summary

1. **Default environment is dev.** Treat prod as read-only unless explicitly authorized.
2. **Default git target is personal branch → PR to develop.** Never skip review.
3. **Schema changes always go through migration files** in `db/migrations/`.
4. **Deploy only via `scripts/`** — see `deployment.mdc`.
5. **Commit and push only when the user asks.**
6. **Implement the smallest correct change**; verify builds and smoke-test when feasible.
7. When the user says "deploy", ask **which app** (admin/vendor/customer/backend) and **which env** (dev/prod) if not specified.
